  <h2>Getting a key</h2>
  <p>Keys are issued by an EduRankAI administrator from the mail console. Write to <a href={'mailto:' + SITE.emails.general}>{SITE.emails.general}</a> with the product, the environments you need and the scopes you expect to use.</p>
